# Copy to .env (gitignored) for local dev/packaging. Never commit real values here.

# SimBrief API key for real plan generation (docs/plans/simbrief-plan-generation.md,
# docs/decisions.md). Application-level, not per-user and not configurable in Settings —
# see decisions.md for why: each pilot still authenticates individually via SimBrief's own
# login when generating, the key only authorizes the request as coming from Flightdeck.
# Baked in at build time via electron-vite's MAIN_VITE_ prefix (https://electron-vite.org),
# so it ships with the packaged app and every user gets working generation with no setup.
MAIN_VITE_SIMBRIEF_API_KEY=
